189	  <p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival · process engineering · 3 Oct 2026</p>
190	  <h1>Batch 10, designed blind</h1>
191	  <p class="lede">Two designers each wrote a workflow for climb batch 10 from its goals alone. Nothing they wrote was run. This page sets the two designs beside the pipeline batch 10 is running on now.</p>
192	
193	  <div class="key" aria-label="How numbers are cited">
194	    <h3>Reading the numbers</h3>
195	    <p><b>M</b> is a million tokens written: cache writes plus new input, with cached reads not counted. That is the project's unit <span class="src">POSITIONS</span>.</p>
196	    <p>Each number carries a tag naming its file:</p>
197	    <ul>
198	      <li><span class="src">B9 §n</span><span class="path">explorations/reviews/batch-9-review.md</span></li>
