303	<section id="now">
304	  <h2><span class="num">3</span>The pipeline batch 10 runs on</h2>
305	  <p class="gist">Nine roles, all Opus but a judge's second ruling. Batch 9 spent 6.88M on it <span class="src">B9 §7</span>.</p>
306	  <p class="note">A rung's chain runs from its worker to its second skeptic. Everything after the rungs is called the <b>tail</b>. Tiers are set in <span class="src">Script :51–58</span>. Each cost below is batch 9's measured spend <span class="src">B9 §7</span>.</p>
307	
308	  <ol class="roles">
309	    <li>
310	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Rung worker</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="count">one per rung</span></div>
311	      <p>Works in its own worktree (a copy of the tree on its own branch), seeded from the one base build. Writes the test, sees it fail, commits it alone, then makes the fix and its specification text, and pushes as it goes.</p>
312	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>2.69M</b> over 6 agents; about <b>2.2M</b> without the VM restart <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
313	    </li>
314	    <li>
315	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Skeptic</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="count">one per rung</span></div>
316	      <p>Reads the worker's transcript to see the test failed first. Runs its own small programs on the new and the old code. Builds nothing. Approves or refuses. Since 3 Oct it refuses only when the fix needs code; a wording or record fix is a <i>required correction</i> that the gather makes <span class="src">Manual</span>.</p>
317	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>1.24M</b> over 4 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
318	    </li>
319	    <li>
320	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Judge</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="tier fable">Fable 2nd ruling</span></div>
321	      <p>Acts on a refusal, before any repair: it rules repair, drop or stop <span class="src">Script :2541–2552</span>. A second ruling on the same rung runs on Fable.</p>
322	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.45M</b> over 2 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
323	    </li>
324	    <li>
325	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Repair</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
326	      <p>One round, in the rung's worktree, on the judge's ruling.</p>
327	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.56M</b> over 2 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
328	    </li>
329	    <li>
